cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Cluster headache: an open evidence base"
message: "If you use this record or its analyses, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: "Vijay"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # optional, free to register
repository-code: "https://github.com/vijaykas/cluster-headache-evidence"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24233067"
version: "v1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, machine-readable record of cluster headache research:
  registered trials and their results, the eight GWAS risk loci and their
  tissue-level effects, mechanism and provocation findings, and the
  research and funding landscape. Includes eight computational analyses
  run against public data, with the code to regenerate them.
keywords:
  - cluster headache
  - trigeminal autonomic cephalalgia
  - headache
  - open data
  - reproducible research
